{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "cddaa8e8d49e9ac05f18b469a4b87cf6338b2e480be25c097e5af5c3fc37766b", "ja": "これは困ったコリアンダー！", "zh": "这下可真让人为难芫荽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f6fca5441c7ebe39a243f9a9071da4270122272893e221d4b46ac33753c1cb19", "ja": "いよいよ試食会。楽しみな可奈は早めに来て\n準備をしていたが、うっかりお米を炊き忘れ\nてしまう。しかし杏奈が作ったのは、お米の\n要らないカレーだった。おおむね好評だった\nが、可奈は物足りなさそうな様子……。", "zh": "终于到了试吃会。期待已久的可奈早早来到并\n做起了准备，却不小心忘了煮米饭。不过，杏奈\n做的是不需要米饭的咖喱。总体上颇受好评，\n但可奈似乎还是觉得有些不过瘾……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "baaa548c39f90bd6b64cf67aa95f68522d8e76fb2805a068427a685629e59372", "ja": "（ゲーミングカレーの試作品が完成したらしい。公演の\nレッスンも大変なのに、杏奈、頑張ってくれたな！）", "zh": "（听说游戏咖喱的试作品终于完成了。明明还要参加公演的课程，杏奈却还是努力帮忙了啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "61a5ae1b2c753cb52c117532c66feee3b7437a6879f0039926e64fc3b0fca027", "ja": "包丁も洗ったし、まな板も洗ったし……準備オッケー！\nあとは、やることなんだろ～？", "zh": "菜刀也洗好了，砧板也洗好了……准备OK！\n接下来要做什么来着～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7211bb39f0cbbad060378aee25030f4a43faa9e91413ce8c919f65e6a864202", "ja": "あれ、可奈？　もう来てたのか。\nもしかして、試食会の準備をしてくれてたのか？", "zh": "哎呀，可奈？你已经来了啊。\n难不成，你是在帮试吃会做准备吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "67bfe92328f6880aec31f2f69e1006a581f4b86f8adf42ee3011aa8e75148db4", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nそうなんです！　私、とっても楽しみで。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n是啊！我特别期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "375bb34065d0b1c028e5efecb40c3311697a4f261d38aebccca3c393fc6a8614", "ja": "カレーって、幸せな気分になりませんか？\nぱくっとひとくち、食べたらウキウキ～♪　えへっ♪", "zh": "咖喱不是会让人感到幸福吗？\n啊呜一口吃下去，心情就会变得雀跃起来～♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bcafe21126ae8c1c41dcf8077dec13b8f52b7a2f14873a22c0c5613cfd53e487", "ja": "うん、そういうイメージはわかる気がするな。\nそれじゃ、今日は気合いを入れて試食しないとな！", "zh": "嗯，我好像挺能理解那种感觉的。\n那么，今天试吃可得好好打起精神来啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "495882d69da86a4015186fa56e07f79fca53994e440a1ada4cba8518b473131d", "ja": "あら？　ふたりとも、早いわね。\nもう準備できちゃったの？", "zh": "哎呀？你们两个真早啊。已经准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "931400f7236099bce18d369b3671d1e9294ce37f32a36079afcbc821d49481fb", "ja": "莉緒、お疲れ様。\n可奈が先に準備しておいてくれたんだ。", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦了。是可奈先帮忙准备好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c7e473fda7ec55f1e975e38d916be856b80800ab43fc43a64f75cad34f31e974", "ja": "そうなのね。ありがと、可奈ちゃん♪\nじゃあ、ご飯も炊けてたりするのかしら？", "zh": "原来是这样。谢谢你，可奈♪\n那么，饭也已经煮好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "c82366ae870b7ac8b10c2b65cee08a1c19da2938ae1ae8b0f63e6e253c8c6553", "ja": "ご飯……？　ごはん……ああっ！！\nご飯炊くの忘れてました～！　ううっ、私のばか～！", "zh": "米饭……？　吃饭……啊！！\n我忘记煮饭了～！呜呜，我真是个笨蛋～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "05a4727523d19883f80b76bab5a8290a5395d084780885590e5c5ae0123c805d", "ja": "大丈夫よ、可奈ちゃん！　まだ時間はあるわ。\n今から炊いても十分、間に合うわよ！", "zh": "没事的，可奈！时间还很充裕呢。\n现在开始煮也完全来得及哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "222e9db6bde05a23c3873e39c2f0b6559fcac9babf75ee39a5987bb8cf4b619e", "ja": "莉緒の言う通りだ。焦らなくても……。\nん？　あれ……炊飯器は？　いつもここに……。", "zh": "就像莉绪说的那样。不用着急……嗯？奇怪，电饭煲呢？平时明明就在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1012_null", "source_sha256": "86a762eecbf33b0c3397431ffa059f4648b2e25081297321784fa07a2765a47c", "ja": "回想……", "zh": "回想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "d66a59e167f6bcb8035c9cb663ee40948490d533387a26379ce4a5a759b486f4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n給湯室の炊飯器、壊れちゃったみたいなんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n茶水间的电饭煲好像坏掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "9613908f896648dd0c4c29c8907159dd0d2a7142061154e1cba328135a66965a", "ja": "修理に出しておきますね！　できれば、新しいのを\n買いたいですけど……経費に余裕があるときに！", "zh": "我先送去修理吧！可以的话，我也想买新的……不过还是等经费宽裕的时候再说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b84d6f58242e8ab569ffe4580e8a14023d200210e847f7c329ae03ae69f3b393", "ja": "あ、あ……あああァーッ！？", "zh": "啊、啊……啊啊啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "36c93ba73fb9436ca89a605b69862e88044d0982e160cebf2e00c7cea8dfdf96", "ja": "え、どうしたの、{$P$}くん？\nいきなり大声出して……。", "zh": "咦，怎么了，{$P$}？\n突然这么大声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "56cc9e0a6364343577bfb154185d76a52c4d31fbc893f81145989f3fc96eba5f", "ja": "い、いやその……今、炊飯器修理に出してるんだった。\n参ったな、すっかり忘れてたよ。", "zh": "不、不是……那个……我现在正把电饭煲送去修呢。\n真伤脑筋，我完全忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "0da643ab739612b59663c1c7bc9f7df47111844bec465934fd02e042e2cfda46", "ja": "お疲れさま、です……。\n大きな声がしたけど……なにか、あった？", "zh": "辛苦了……。\n刚才听到很大的声音……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "43dc9246296aeac837f6f3aa977a58dac090c7c60a03302384b84fbe157b8e68", "ja": "あっ！　杏奈ちゃん……ご、ごめんなさい！\n試食会なのに、私、ご飯炊き忘れちゃって……！", "zh": "啊！杏奈……对、对不起！\n明明是试吃会，我却把煮饭的事给忘了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3596dd59fa9c6933c2830b42a715ec2b0aaec96b37457efe6566e5a3171ca905", "ja": "いや、謝るのは俺だよ。ゴメンな、杏奈。\n炊飯器が壊れてるの、忘れてて……。", "zh": "不，该道歉的是我。抱歉啊，杏奈。\n我忘了电饭煲坏掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "567fa050f54e65cbd17728befa4ed8dcabcf270290a5ddd070c278fe8621638e", "ja": "えっと……ちょっと、よくわからない、けど……。\n今日はご飯……いらない、よ……？", "zh": "那个……虽然有点搞不明白……  \n今天不用吃饭……了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "4143f22fd589d2ab5f5c3289efaafcbfdf52ea18139b56a199f3c172defb44ae", "ja": "え？　……ええっ！？\nカレーだよね？　なのに、ご飯いらないの？", "zh": "诶？……诶诶！？\n是咖喱吧？既然这样，为什么不要米饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "3716384fef0a5df56e6a8d9fcc6a43e1c57c26ffa2c3d5cc6ad79ee59b11cc69", "ja": "うん……。下準備も……済ませてきた、から……。\nすぐ、食べられる、よ……。", "zh": "嗯……因为准备工作……都已经做好了……所以……马上就能吃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "955e2d5855ee793de9f9ffb98c69a1571f63f2fde417af39cf666646ee916bd8", "ja": "えっ？　手際いいのね、杏奈ちゃん！\nそれじゃ、私たちが手伝うことは？", "zh": "诶？你动作真利落呢，杏奈！\n那么，我们要帮忙做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "98734077d00cc0a5b6def2a4841df1e4499ca741262196146de0fb76c80fdcc7", "ja": "んと、完成するまで……待ってて……？\nそんなに、時間……かからない、から……。", "zh": "那个，等做好之前……先等等……？\n不会……花太多，时间、的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "aa62e7b4082acf4a6648c5a78a8cab4d3780af3d531285f38a69afe011c50cf4", "ja": "完成、です……。\nこれが……杏奈の、ゲーミングカレー……イェイ♪", "zh": "做好了……\n这就是……杏奈的，电竞咖喱……耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "7bce6d094f8d97ddb463eda3ea5a021142818444367d7bfb69b96b397aae9737", "ja": "こ……このコップに入ってるのが……カレー？\nカレー……カレー？", "zh": "这……这个杯子里装的是……咖喱？  \n咖喱……咖喱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "e860c0a3099a6ade46dc79f58a8c0584eaeb6ae49bc450ea3c97e268f9abc182", "ja": "たしかに、色や匂いはカレーだけど……\n具も見えないから、なんだか飲み物みたいね？", "zh": "确实，颜色和气味都是咖喱……  \n不过因为看不见食材，总觉得像饮料一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "983c5383d91c7d2e18cff97e4926086e4b3cf834c4b7a2808fadc50d882cf900", "ja": "うん……具材は、ミキサーで……細かくしたから……。\n煮込んで、溶けてるよ……。", "zh": "嗯……因为食材用搅拌机……打碎了……\n炖煮之后，都溶化在里面了哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "b0b205149af53538f26eca03a1ca92401ac1e4266aac003c49311db374d3c49d", "ja": "パウチに入れて……飲み口、つけたら……\n手軽に……補給、完了です……♪", "zh": "装进袋子里……装上吸嘴之后……\n就能轻松……补充完成了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
