{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "dadd413933a2901d2a3f4f91e3f5530349c12dfa1a4bf61320e37378d9e35718", "ja": "……うん！　コクがあってすごく美味しいわ！\nこの本格的な味、見た目からは想像できないわね～。", "zh": "……嗯！口感浓郁，非常好喝呢！\n光看外表，完全想不到味道会这么地道呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "98572594e81de3e55c461e0118e6a8406cbf83f9b36ef7d1033028a9e1f5ce8b", "ja": "あ、ホントだ……。おいしいけど、ううっ……。\nちょっぴり、私には辛いかも……。", "zh": "啊，真的……很好吃，不过，呜……  \n对我来说可能有一点辣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
