{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "94c89acef6650bedc9faf064b66c2f518da72a4818e1635e84da1593ba44d4ed", "ja": "ん……。でも、試作品第一号は……まあまあ、かな。\nみんな、ありがとう……また味見して、ね……♪", "zh": "嗯……不过，试作品第一号……还算可以吧。\n大家，谢谢你们……下次也要再帮我尝尝哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_04_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "2c5c13c8d1ceb4bec21d108c1200e0b3ee8c0ef8e1dab6da57aa037ccd30d562", "ja": "ねえ、杏奈ちゃん？　その……。", "zh": "那个，杏奈？就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
